#. Tag: title
#: configuration.docbook:694
#, no-c-format
msgid "Install Files Conduit Setup"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: configuration.docbook:696
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The Install Files Conduit installs any &PalmPilot; database that has been "
"added to &kpilot;'s File Install window onto the &handheld;. No additional "
"configuration is required for this conduit."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: configuration.docbook:705
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>Calendar Conduit Setup</title>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: configuration.docbook:707
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This conduit will synchronize your &PalmPilot; with &korganizer; and "
"&kontact; by using Akonadi. Before you can use this conduit, you must "
"configure Akonadi to have a resource for the calendar that you wish to "
"synchronize with. Once you've done that, you can select that resource for "
"synchronization use here."
msgstr ""

